---
// Applies the reader's saved TextProv preference to the root element before
// first paint, so a page opens in the chosen state without a flash. Rendered by
// TextProvMarker.astro (every enrolled page) and TextProvControls.astro (every
// page with a table of contents), so a page with the controls but no recorded
// AI text still shows the switch in its saved position. Running it twice on an
// enrolled page is harmless. display.ts owns the storage key.
---

<script is:inline>
  try { document.documentElement.dataset.textprov = localStorage.getItem('docs:textprov') === 'shown' ? 'shown' : 'hidden'; }
  catch { document.documentElement.dataset.textprov = 'hidden'; }
</script>
